{
  "description": "Web paths the backend Projects/Clients modules put into notifications (Modules/Projects/DeliveryShared.cs DeliveryLinks). A backend unit test keeps DeliveryLinks and this file identical; deliveryLinks.test.ts resolves every path against the real router.",
